{#- The header, once, instead of seven times.

    It varied across the pages in exactly three ways and nothing else: which nav
    link carries aria-current, where the quote button points, and what the two
    quote buttons say. Everything else was identical down to the whitespace, so
    everything else is fixed here.

    Pages set these in their front matter and inherit the defaults otherwise:

      navCurrent   which nav key is the current page, or omitted for none
      ctaHref      where both quote buttons point       (default contact.html)
      ctaNavLabel  the label inside the drawer          (default Get my free quote)
      ctaBarLabel  the label out on the bar             (default Get my free quote)

    thanks.html and 404.html are the reason the labels are separate: neither has
    a form to send anyone to, so both buttons become the phone number, and the
    drawer says it in full while the bar says "Call instead". -#}
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="shell site-header__inner">
    <a class="brand" href="index.html" aria-label="{{ site.name }}, home">
      <svg class="brand__mark" viewBox="0 0 64 34" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M3 24h6M55 24h6M9 24c0-3 2.4-5.4 5.4-5.4S19.8 21 19.8 24 17.4 29.4 14.4 29.4 9 27 9 24Z"/>
        <path d="M44 24c0-3 2.4-5.4 5.4-5.4S54.8 21 54.8 24s-2.4 5.4-5.4 5.4S44 27 44 24Z"/>
        <path d="M19.8 24h24.4"/>
        <path d="M4 21c1-5.5 3-8 6-8.6l9-5.2c2-1.2 4.3-1.6 6.6-1.2l14 2.6c2 .4 3.8 1.4 5.2 2.9l4.4 4.6 8 1.8c3 .7 4.8 2.5 4.8 5"/>
        <path d="M17 12.4h13.6M33 8.2 36 15"/>
      </svg>
      <span class="brand__text">
        <span class="brand__name">{{ site.name }}</span>
        <span class="brand__tag">{{ site.tagline }}</span>
      </span>
    </a>

    <button class="nav-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="primary-nav" aria-label="Open menu">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"/></svg>
    </button>

    <nav class="nav" id="primary-nav" data-open="false" aria-label="Main">
{%- for item in site.nav %}
      <a href="{{ item.href }}"{% if item.key == navCurrent %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ item.label | safe }}</a>
{%- endfor %}
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" href="{{ ctaHref | default('contact.html') }}">{{ ctaNavLabel | default('Get my free quote') }}</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="header__cta">
      <a class="header__phone" href="tel:{{ site.phone.tel }}">{{ site.phone.display }}</a>
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" href="{{ ctaHref | default('contact.html') }}">{{ ctaBarLabel | default('Get my free quote') }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
